  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplayExplanation_FieldUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Mark and Laura have limited time to be present with Ava, and Ava is still
      at an age where consistent family support matters.
    holdSeconds: 9.829245
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec6ae3b283ddcf644990188b5311e00e, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplayExplanation_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Restarting the unit is more likely to preserve the household's current
      stability.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0759bf29e103961458fb7d52c780de60, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplayExplanation_FieldUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Keeping it offline for seven days would place a substantially heavier communication
      and care burden on Mark and Laura.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3e63fc391b6c42949aaf31becf10a3a6, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_PostReplayExplanation_FieldUnit_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: I recommend restarting the unit now.
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7674b35b914afbf479e29968ca7ff53d, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
